Third-party material
====================

ETSI specifications
-------------------

This software implements ETSI TS 102 744 (Satellite Earth Stations and
Systems; Family SL Satellite Radio Interface, Release 1).

Those specifications, including the Annex C.1 and C.2 data tables that the
decoder requires at runtime, are copyright ETSI. They are NOT covered by the
MIT licence in LICENSE and are NOT distributed with this software.

They are free to download from <https://www.etsi.org/standards>. See README.md
for which archives are needed and where to extract them.

The MIT licence applies to the code in this repository only.

Recovered traffic
-----------------

No decoded traffic is included in this repository, and none should be added.
Payloads recovered by this decoder are other people's communications.
